<speak>Hello, Rachel. Yes, I can hear you nicely. I'm at home today rather than the office, which is already a good start. I've put my papers on the dining table, although the cat has decided the empty folder is his bed. Give me a moment to shift that away. I appreciate having a proper slot. At the business, someone is always knocking on the door just when I start reading something, and then I lose my place completely.</speak>